    "body": "@marti1125 the idea is to get rid of these lines:\n\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/blob/36fe930da319dd0fe5b28ea8b9b5916a5acbc775/.htaccess#L18-L52\n\nI think you can just delete all of them. Then it will fall back to using https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/httpd/httpd/trunk/docs/conf/mime.types which already includes all of those. (Except it will change `.ttf` from `application/octet-stream` to `application/x-font-ttf`, which will probably be fine.)\n\nYou will also want to delete the line https://github.com/whatwg/html/blob/36fe930da319dd0fe5b28ea8b9b5916a5acbc775/.htaccess#L14\n",
